  "decision_conditions": [
    "Noise from the proposed air source heat pump and external AC condenser referred to in the application shall not exceed the rating level (LAr) predicted in the submitted Plant Noise Assessment (Report Ref: R11080-1 Rev 0, dated 7 August 2025), namely 19 dBA at 28 St Georges Road and 26 dBA at 32 St Georges Road, at any time when the plant is operating. The noise level shall be measured or calculated at 1.0 metre from the façade of the nearest residential premises. The plant shall be serviced regularly in accordance with the manufacturer’s instructions and as necessary to ensure compliance with this condition. If at any time the Local Planning Authority determines that the plant fails to comply, it shall be switched off upon written instruction and shall not be used again until it can be demonstrated to the satisfaction of the Local Planning Authority that it complies with this condition.\r\n\r\nREASON: To protect the residential amenity of nearby occupants."
  ],
